(2103, 'KITAFC', 'UN', '0', 87, 85, 168, 'Kit Linha Facial Argila Rosa 2', 'Compre Kit Linha Facial Argila Rosa 2 da Ruby Rose com 7% de desconto á vista no Boleto', '<p><strong><em><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\">KIT ARGILA ROSA &ndash; FACIAL</span></em></strong><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large; background-color: #ffffff;\">Este kit foi produzido para voc&ecirc; que deseja um tratamento para ajudar na redu&ccedil;&atilde;o e controle da oleosidade. Ele &eacute; indicado para todos os tipos de pele, mas se voc&ecirc; tem a pele mais sens&iacute;vel, delicada, avermelhada, com tend&ecirc;ncias al&eacute;rgicas ou ros&aacute;cea tamb&eacute;m vai amar essa linha! A argila rosa &eacute; rica em &oacute;xido de ferro e ajuda na respira&ccedil;&atilde;o das c&eacute;lulas, na transfer&ecirc;ncia de el&eacute;trons, deixando a pele bem hidratada, prevenindo o envelhecimento precoce.</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\">Siga esses 3 passos e conquiste uma pele saud&aacute;vel e bonita</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: large;\"><strong><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">Passo 1:&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">Sabonete L&iacute;quido que auxilia no controle da oleosidade. Proporciona uma espuma de limpeza que hidrata e limpa gentilmente, oferecendo conforto e suavidade a pele, deixando-a renovada e com um brilho natural. &Eacute; elaborado com argila rosa, rico em sais minerais, provitamina B5 e fito extratos e possui a&ccedil;&atilde;o antiss&eacute;ptica, revitalizando e hidratante.</span></span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: large;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">Modo de usar:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">Aplicar sobre o rosto &uacute;mido massageando bem em movimentos circulares por alguns segundos at&eacute; obter a espuma e limpeza desejada, em seguida enx&aacute;gue completamente. N&atilde;o aproximar dos olhos.</span></span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: large;\"><strong><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">Passo 2:&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">Esfoliante Facial, sua f&oacute;rmula &eacute; rica em argila rosa, sais minerais, aloe vera, e extrato de algas marinhas que proporciona uma pele limpa, renovada, macia e saud&aacute;vel, desobstruindo os poros e removendo as impurezas acumuladas.</span></span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: large;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">Modo de uso:</span><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;Aplicar o esfoliante sobre a &aacute;rea desejada evitando a regi&atilde;o dos olhos, massageie bem em movimentos circulares at&eacute; obter a limpeza e esfolia&ccedil;&atilde;o desejada. Enx&aacute;gue at&eacute; a remo&ccedil;&atilde;o completa.</span></span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: large;\"><strong><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">Passo 3:</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;M&aacute;scara Facial, possui a&ccedil;&atilde;o revitalizante e auxilia no controle da oleosidade excessiva, sua f&oacute;rmula cont&eacute;m provitamina B5. Age limpando gentilmente e deixando a pele aveludada e sedosa.</span></span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: large;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">Modo de Uso:</span><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;Com a pele limpa, aplique a m&aacute;scara no rosto evitando a regi&atilde;o dos olhos e l&aacute;bios. Deixe agir por cerca de 20 minutos, remova com &aacute;gua morna e seque o rosto delicadamente.</span></span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><strong><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\">Indica&ccedil;&otilde;es:</span></strong><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large; background-color: #ffffff;\">Para todos os tipos de pele</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large; background-color: #ffffff;\">*N&atilde;o tem contraindica&ccedil;&atilde;o</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large; background-color: #ffffff;\">*Testado dermatologicamente</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large; background-color: #ffffff;\">*PODE SER USADO AT&Eacute; 2X NA SEMANA - Esfoliante, M&aacute;scara</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large; background-color: #ffffff;\">*PODE SER USADO TODOS OS DIAS - Sabonete</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\">As imagens do Kit Linha Facial Argila Rosa s&atilde;o meramente ilustrativas</span></p>', 28.69, 54.43, 3.00, 20.00, 6.00, '', '', 0, 'N', 0.900, 'S', 0, NULL, 'N', '', 'kit-linha-facial-argila-rosa-2', 'Kit Linha Facial Argila Rosa 2', '2020-09-22 08:43:16', '2020-12-28 18:35:34', 16, 22, 13),
