r: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: large;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">Modo de Uso:</span><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;Com a pele limpa, aplique a m&aacute;scara no rosto evitando a regi&atilde;o dos olhos e l&aacute;bios. Deixe agir por cerca de 20 minutos, remova com &aacute;gua morna e seque o rosto delicadamente.</span></span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: large;\"><strong><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">Passo 4:</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;S&eacute;rum, sua textura &eacute; leve, sem deixar a pele oleosa, foi desenvolvido para todos os tipos de pele. Elaborado com argila rosa, sais minerais, col&aacute;geno, elastina e provitamina B5, ajuda a promover uma pele hidratada e com toque sedoso. &Eacute; livre de parabenos.</span></span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: large;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">Modo de usar:</span><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;Com o rosto limpo, aplique o s&eacute;rum, massageando at&eacute; a completa absor&ccedil;&atilde;o do produto.</span></span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><strong><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\">Indica&ccedil;&otilde;es:</span></strong><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large; background-color: #ffffff;\">Para todos os tipos de pele</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large; background-color: #ffffff;\">*N&atilde;o tem contraindica&ccedil;&atilde;o</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large; background-color: #ffffff;\">*Testado dermatologicamente</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large; background-color: #ffffff;\">*PODE SER USADO AT&Eacute; 2X NA SEMANA - Esfoliante, M&aacute;scara e S&eacute;rum</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large; background-color: #ffffff;\">*PODE SER USADO TODOS OS DIAS - Sabonete</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\">As imagens do Kit Linha Facial Argila Rosa s&atilde;o meramente ilustrativas</span></p>', 41.94, 77.70, 3.00, 20.00, 5.00, '', '', 0, 'N', 1.000, 'S', 0, NULL, 'N', '', 'kit-linha-facial-argila-rosa', 'Kit Linha Facial Argila Rosa ', '2020-09-22 08:46:00', '2020-12-28 18:36:11', 18, 24, 13),
(2105, 'HB8050B2', 'UN', '0', 87, 85, 138, 'Base Líquida Soft Matte Bege 2', 'Compre Base Líquida Soft Matte Bege 2 da Ruby Rose com 7% de descotno à vista no Boleto', '<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\">Quando o assunto &eacute; maquiagem, sempre queremos uma pele perfeita e natural. Pensando em voc&ecirc;, a Ruby Rose lan&ccedil;a a nova Base Soft Matte.</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\"><br /></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\">Uma base desenvolvida para conter a oleosidade da pele e disfar&ccedil;ar as imperfei&ccedil;&otilde;es, al&eacute;m de proporcionar um excelente acabamento, alta cobertura e longa dura&ccedil;&atilde;o. A base possui 14 tonalidades diferentes, divididas nas categorias: NUDE, BEGE e CHOCOLATE, &eacute; s&oacute; escolher a que melhor se adapta ao seu tom de pele e arrasar.</span></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\">&bull;Cor: Bege Natural</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\">&bull;Refer&ecirc;ncia: HB8050B2</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\">&bull;Peso L&iacute;quido: 29ML</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\"><br /></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\"><br /></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\"><br /></span></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\"><br /></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\"><br /></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\"><br /></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\">Sugest&otilde;es de aplica&ccedil;&atilde;o da Base L&iacute;quida Soft Matte Bege 2:</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\"><br /></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\"><br /></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\"><br /></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\">Toda maquiagem necessita de um bom Primer Facial para fixa&ccedil;&atilde;o antes da aplica&ccedil;&atilde;o. A Base L&iacute;quida Soft Matte tem alta cobertura e &eacute; muito f&aacute;cil de espalhar, utilize um pincel ou esponja para espalhar a base, comece a aplicar a partir do centro do rosto e misture-o para fora, para que dessa forma ela fique uniforme no rosto inteiro. N&atilde;o se esque&ccedil;a da &aacute;rea do pesco&ccedil;o, e para um melhor resultado sele com o p&oacute;.</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\"><br /></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\"><br /></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\"><br /></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\">Precau&ccedil;&otilde;es:</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\"><br /></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\"><br /></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\"><br /></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\">Uso externo. N&atilde;o aplique sobre a pele irritada ou lesionada. Se houver qualquer sinal de irrita&ccedil;&atilde;o, descontinue o uso do produto! Evite espinhas limpe bem sua pele ap&oacute;s o uso! Toda pele merece de cuidados como hidrata&ccedil;&atilde;o e esfolia&ccedil;&atilde;o.</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\"><br /></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\"><br /></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\"><br /></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\">Componentes:</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\"><br /></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\">Aqua, Cyclomethicone, Titanium Dioxide, Silica, Paraffinum Liquidum, Dimethicone, Isopropyl Myristate, Propylene Glycol, Polyglyceryl-2 Diisostearate, Squalene, Microcrystalline Wax, Magnesium Stearate, Polyglyceryl-2 Isostearate, PEG-30 Dipolyhydroxystearate, Phenoxyethanol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Parfum, Benzyl benzoate, Linalool</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\"><br /></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\"><br /></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\"><br /></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\">Pode conter: CI 77491, CI 77499, CI 77492, CI 77891</span></span></p>', 9.87, 16.00, 2.00, 20.00, 0.00, '', '', 0, 'N', 0.150, 'N', 0, NULL, 'N', '', 'base-liquida-soft-matte-bege-2', 'Base Líquida Soft Matte Bege 2', '2020-09-22 08:51:07', '2023-12-23 14:24:04', 16, 11, 6),
(2106, 'HB312', 'UN', '0', 87, 85, 139, 'Fixador de Maquiagem Ruby Rose', 'Compre Fixador de Maquiagem Ruby Rose com 7% de desconto à vista no Boleto', '<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\">O Fixador de Maquiagem da Ruby Rose</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\">Quer ter uma make impecavel at&eacute; o fim do dia? Aposte no fixador de maquiagem.</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\">ele foi desenvolvido especialmente para prolongar a dura&ccedil;&atilde;o da make.</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\">O produto possui secagem r&aacute;pida fazendo com que a pele n&atilde;o fique &uacute;mida. Ao aplicar, o fixador n&atilde;o ir&aacute; molhar o rosto e nem borrar a sua make, al&eacute;m disso possui um cheirinho suave e agrad&aacute;vel.</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\"><br /></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\">Indicado</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\">Para todos os tipos de pele.</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\">Benef&iacute;cios</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\">- Fixa a maquiagem, fazendo durar por mais horas;</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\">- Cheirinho agrad&aacute;vel;</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\">- Cruelty Free;</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\">- Da acabamento a maquiagem;</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\">- N&atilde;o possui sensa&ccedil;&atilde;o oleosa na pele;</span></span></p>', 10.71, 16.99, 1.00, 20.00, 0.00, '', '', 0, 'N', NULL, 'N', 0, NULL, 'N', '', 'fixador-de-maquiagem-ruby-rose', 'Fixador de Maquiagem Ruby Rose', '2020-09-22 08:56:12', '2021-03-23 10:47:47', NULL, NULL, NULL);
