(2108, 'HB7509D', 'UN', '0', 87, 85, 143, 'Paleta Perfect Me Dark', 'Compre Paleta Perfect Me Dark Ruby Rose com 7% de desconto à vista no Boleto', '<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Experimente a nova Paleta Perfect Me Dark da Ruby Rose, o produto disp&otilde;e de nove op&ccedil;&otilde;es de tonalidades e modelos para aplica&ccedil;&atilde;o, fa&ccedil;a com que a sua maquiagem fique ainda mais radiante! A Paleta Dark &eacute; indicada para peles negras e de tons m&eacute;dio.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 25px;\"><br /></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">&bull; Refer&ecirc;ncia: HB7509D</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">&bull; Total de Cores: 9</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">1 Iluminador em creme</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">2,3,4 e 5 Quatro tons de Contorno em Creme</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">6,7 e 8 Tr&ecirc;s tons de P&oacute; para Contorno</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">9 Iluminador com um toque levemente aveludado</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">As Imagens da nova paleta da Paleta Perfect Me Dark 7509 s&atilde;o meramente ilustrativas! Visualiza&ccedil;&otilde;es em mobile e desktop podem sofrer uma altera&ccedil;&atilde;o de cor.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">Sugest&otilde;es de aplica&ccedil;&atilde;o da Paleta Perfect Me Dark:</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">Os tons claros s&atilde;o iluminadores, utilizados para destacar e aproximar. Os tons escuros s&atilde;o contornos, utilizados para diminuir os pontos desejados. Para um efeito suave, lembre-se de esfumar bem todos os pontos onde o Corretivo e Contorno for aplicado.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">Precau&ccedil;&otilde;es:</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">Uso externo. N&atilde;o aplique sobre a pele irritada ou lesionada. Se houver qualquer sinal de irrita&ccedil;&atilde;o, descontinue o uso do produto! Evite espinhas limpe bem sua pele ap&oacute;s o uso! Toda pele merece de cuidados como hidrata&ccedil;&atilde;o e esfolia&ccedil;&atilde;o.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">Componentes:</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">1 &ndash; Cream Highlighter: Squalene, Isononyl Isononanoate, Pentaerythrityl Tetracocoate, Silica, Methicone, Ceresin, Beeswax, Ethylhexyl Palmitate, Paraffinum Liquidum, Diglyceryl Adipate-Caprate-Caprylate-Hydroxystearate-Isostearate-Stearate, Hydroxystearic Acid, Parfum, Benzyl Benzoate, Linalool</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">Pode conter: Mica, Tin Oxide, CI 77491, CI 77891</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 25px;\"><br /></span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">9 &ndash; Powder Highlighter: Bismuth Oxychloride, Magnesium Stearate, Petrolatum, Isononyl Isononanoate, Caprylic - Capric Triglyceride, Squalene, Paraffinum Liquidum, Diglyceryl Adipate-Caprate-Caprylate-Hydroxystearate-Isostearate-Stearate, Phenoxyethanol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Parfum, Benzyl Benzoate, Linalool</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">Pode conter: Mica, CI 77891, CI 77491, CI 77499, CI 77492</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">6,7,8 &ndash; Powder Contour: Talc, Mica, Magnesium Stearate, Silica, Paraffinum Liquidum, Titanium Dioxide, Polyisobutene, Macadamia Ternifolia Seed Oil, Caprylic - Capric Triglyceride, Ethylhexyl Palmitate, Diglyceryl Adipate-Caprate-Caprylate-Hydroxystearate-Isostearate-Stearate,Cyclomethicone, Phenoxyethanol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Parfum, Alpha-Isomethyl Ionone, Benzyl Benzoate, Butylphenyl Methylpropional, Coumarin, Geraniol, Isoeugenol, Limonene, Linalool</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">Pode conter: CI 77491, CI 77499, CI 15850, CI 77492</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">2,3,4,5 &ndash; Cream Contour: Caprylic - Capric Triglyceride, Isononyl Isononanoate, Paraffinum Liquidum, Tridecyl Trimellitate, Titanium Dioxide, Beeswax, Ceresin, Polymethyl Methacyrlate, Hydrolyzed Theobroma Cacao Seed Butter, Diglyceryl Adipate-Caprate-Caprylate-Hydroxystearate-Isostearate-Stearate,Cyclomethicone, Hydrated Silica, Hydroxystearic Acid,</span></p>', 20.66, 37.80, 2.00, 20.00, 0.00, '', '', 0, 'N', 0.200, 'N', 0, NULL, 'N', '', 'paleta-perfect-me-dark', 'Paleta Perfect Me Dark', '2020-09-22 09:10:15', '2022-09-01 15:55:33', 22, 15, 6),
