(2154, 'HB8607302', 'UN', '0', 87, 85, 150, 'Batom Duo Matte 302', 'Compre Batom Duo Matte 302 Ruby Rose com 7% de desconto à vista no Boleto', '<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">A Ruby Rose lan&ccedil;a a nova cole&ccedil;&atilde;o de Batom Duo Matte com 16 cores perfeitas para valorizar ainda mais a sua maquiagem.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">Nas op&ccedil;&otilde;es bala e l&iacute;quida sua f&oacute;rmula incrivelmente pigmentada e de secagem r&aacute;pida, proporciona uma cobertura alta e de longa dura&ccedil;&atilde;o. Sem contar que tem um acabamento matte, perfeito para seu dia a dia.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">&bull; Cor:</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">&bull; Refer&ecirc;ncia: HB8607302</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">&bull; Efeito: Matte</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">&bull; Design: Moderno e f&aacute;cil de utilizar</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">&bull; Produto dois em um, bala e l&iacute;quido</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">As Imagens do produto s&atilde;o meramente ilustrativas! Visualiza&ccedil;&otilde;es em mobile e desktop podem sofrer altera&ccedil;&atilde;o de cor.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">Sugest&otilde;es de aplica&ccedil;&atilde;o:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">Temos duas formas de aplica&ccedil;&atilde;o: bala ou l&iacute;quido!</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">&bull; Aplica&ccedil;&atilde;o em Bala: Aplique em seus l&aacute;bios e tenha um efeito Matte com resultado natural</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">&bull; Aplica&ccedil;&atilde;o em L&iacute;quido: Utilizando o aplicador contorne os l&aacute;bios com o batom l&iacute;quido e deixe o secar, ap&oacute;s o procedimento voc&ecirc; obter&aacute; o efeito Matte perfeito.</span></p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">Dica para efeito do Batom Duo Matte</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">&bull; Se voc&ecirc; preferir deixar os seus l&aacute;bios bem selados, aplique o Batom Duo Matte em bala e, logo ap&oacute;s, utilize o l&iacute;quido para delinear o contorno da boca, espere secar e pronto, o resultado &eacute; incr&iacute;vel.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">Componentes:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">Batom Bala: Isononyl Isononanoate, Pentaerythrityl Tetracocoate, Octyldodecanol, Synthetic Wax, Silica, Methicone, Caprylic - Capric Triglyceride, Beeswax, Hydrogenated Castor Oil, C12-15 Alkyl Benozate, Candelilla Cera, Cyclopentasiloxane, Dimethicone, Parfum, Citral, Geraniol, Citronellol, Linalool</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">Pode conter: Mica, Tin oxide, CI 77941, CI 77891, CI 77499, CI 45410, CI 15850, CI 77492, CI 19140, CI 42090, CI 15985, CI 17200, CI 75470</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">Batom L&iacute;quido: Isododecane, Ethylene-Propylene-Styrene Copolymer, Ceresin, Cyclopentasiloxane, Hydrated Silica, Caprylic - Capric Triglyceride, Paraffinum Liquidum, Mica, Parfum, Cinnamyl Alcohol, Limonene, Linalool</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">Pode conter: Mica, Tin oxide, CI 77941, CI 77891, CI 77499, CI 45410, CI 15850, CI 77492, CI 19140, CI 42090, CI 15985, CI 17200, CI 75470</span></p>', 9.95, 15.38, 2.00, 12.00, 0.00, '', '', 0, 'N', NULL, 'N', 0, NULL, 'N', '', 'batom-duo-matte-302', 'Batom Duo Matte 302', '2020-10-06 17:28:03', '2022-08-27 16:43:57', NULL, NULL, NULL),
