(2161, 'HB8607303', 'UN', '0', 87, 85, 150, 'Batom Duo Matte 303', 'Compre Batom Duo Matte 303 com 7% de desconto à vista no Boleto', '<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">A&nbsp;</span><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">Ruby Rose</span><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;lan&ccedil;a a nova cole&ccedil;&atilde;o de Batom Duo Matte com 16 cores perfeitas para valorizar ainda mais a sua maquiagem.</span></span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large; background-color: #ffffff;\">Nas op&ccedil;&otilde;es bala e l&iacute;quida sua f&oacute;rmula incrivelmente pigmentada e de secagem r&aacute;pida, proporciona uma cobertura alta e de longa dura&ccedil;&atilde;o. Sem contar que tem um acabamento matte, perfeito para seu dia a dia.</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large; background-color: #ffffff;\">&bull; Cor:</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large; background-color: #ffffff;\">&bull; Refer&ecirc;ncia: HB8607303</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large; background-color: #ffffff;\">&bull; Efeito: Matte</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large; background-color: #ffffff;\">&bull; Design: Moderno e f&aacute;cil de utilizar</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large; background-color: #ffffff;\">&bull; Produto dois em um, bala e l&iacute;quido</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\">As Imagens do produto s&atilde;o meramente ilustrativas! Visualiza&ccedil;&otilde;es em mobile e desktop podem sofrer altera&ccedil;&atilde;o de cor.</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><strong><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large; color: #000000; background-color: #ffffff;\">Sugest&otilde;es de aplica&ccedil;&atilde;o:</span></strong><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large; background-color: #ffffff;\">Temos duas formas de aplica&ccedil;&atilde;o: bala ou l&iacute;quido!</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large; background-color: #ffffff;\">&bull; Aplica&ccedil;&atilde;o em Bala: Aplique em seus l&aacute;bios e tenha um efeito Matte com resultado natural</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large; background-color: #ffffff;\">&bull; Aplica&ccedil;&atilde;o em L&iacute;quido: Utilizando o aplicador contorne os l&aacute;bios com o batom l&iacute;quido e deixe o secar, ap&oacute;s o procedimento voc&ecirc; obter&aacute; o efeito Matte perfeito.</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large; background-color: #ffffff;\">Dica para efeito do Batom Duo Matte</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large; background-color: #ffffff;\">&bull; Se voc&ecirc; preferir deixar os seus l&aacute;bios bem selados, aplique o Batom Duo Matte em bala e, logo ap&oacute;s, utilize o l&iacute;quido para delinear o contorno da boca, espere secar e pronto, o resultado &eacute; incr&iacute;vel.</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: large;\"><strong><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">Componentes:</span></strong></span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large; background-color: #ffffff;\">Batom Bala: Isononyl Isononanoate, Pentaerythrityl Tetracocoate, Octyldodecanol, Synthetic Wax, Silica, Methicone, Caprylic - Capric Triglyceride, Beeswax, Hydrogenated Castor Oil, C12-15 Alkyl Benozate, Candelilla Cera, Cyclopentasiloxane, Dimethicone, Parfum, Citral, Geraniol, Citronellol, Linalool</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large; background-color: #ffffff;\">Pode conter: Mica, Tin oxide, CI 77941, CI 77891, CI 77499, CI 45410, CI 15850, CI 77492, CI 19140, CI 42090, CI 15985, CI 17200, CI 75470</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large; background-color: #ffffff;\">Batom L&iacute;quido: Isododecane, Ethylene-Propylene-Styrene Copolymer, Ceresin, Cyclopentasiloxane, Hydrated Silica, Caprylic - Capric Triglyceride, Paraffinum Liquidum, Mica, Parfum, Cinnamyl Alcohol, Limonene, Linalool</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px;\" /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large; background-color: #ffffff;\">Pode conter: Mica, Tin oxide, CI 77941, CI 77891, CI 77499, CI 45410, CI 15850, CI 77492, CI 19140, CI 42090, CI 15985, CI 17200, CI 75470</span></p>', 9.95, 15.38, 2.00, 12.00, 0.00, '', '', 0, 'N', NULL, 'N', 0, NULL, 'N', '', 'batom-duo-matte-303', 'Batom Duo Matte 303', '2020-10-06 19:38:18', '2022-08-27 16:44:25', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2162, 'HB85161', 'UN', '0', 87, 85, 150, 'Batom Matte Vermelho Vivo 1', 'Compre Batom Matte 001 Vermelho Vivo Ruby Rose com 7% de desconto à vista no Boleto', '<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px; color: #4d4d4d; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: medium;\">Use o B<strong><em>atom Matte 8516 01 Vermelho Vivo</em></strong> da Ruby Rose e tenha um acabamento Matte natural!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px; color: #4d4d4d; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px; color: #4d4d4d; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px; color: #4d4d4d; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: medium;\">A linha do <strong>Batom Matte 8516 001 Vermelho Vivo</strong> tem efeito Semi-Matte e cont&eacute;m mais de 36 cores com alta cobertura para voc&ecirc; expressar de forma aut&ecirc;ntica a sua personalidade, atrav&eacute;s das cores que variam entre neutras e vibrantes!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px; color: #4d4d4d; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px; color: #4d4d4d; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"><strong>Cor:</strong> Vermelho Vivo</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px; color: #4d4d4d; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\"><strong>Refer&ecirc;ncia:</strong> HB85161</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px; color: #4d4d4d; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\"><strong>Efeito:</strong> Semi-Matte</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px; color: #4d4d4d; background-color: #ffffff;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\"><strong>Design:</strong> Moderno e f&aacute;cil de utilizar</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px; color: #4d4d4d; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px; color: #4d4d4d; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: medium;\">As Imagens do <strong>Batom Matte 8516 01</strong> s&atilde;o meramente ilustrativas. Visualiza&ccedil;&otilde;es em mobile e desktop podem sofrer altera&ccedil;&otilde;es de cor.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px; color: #4d4d4d; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px; color: #4d4d4d; background-color: #ffffff;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">Sugest&otilde;es de aplica&ccedil;&atilde;o do Batom</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px; color: #4d4d4d; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">Aplique o Batom canto em dire&ccedil;&atilde;o ao centro dos l&aacute;bios, logo depois preencha a parte interna deixando-o uniforme.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px; color: #4d4d4d; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px; color: #4d4d4d; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: medium;\">Para finalizar, caso voc&ecirc; borre ou cometa alguma falha na aplica&ccedil;&atilde;o a mesma pode ser removida com um lencinho ou cotonete.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px; color: #4d4d4d; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px; color: #4d4d4d; background-color: #ffffff;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: medium;\">Precau&ccedil;&otilde;es:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px; color: #4d4d4d; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">Uso externo. N&atilde;o aplique sobre a pele irritada ou lesionada. Se houver qualquer sinal de irrita&ccedil;&atilde;o, descontinue o uso do produto! Mantenha em ambientes com temperatura at&eacute; 40&ordm; C.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px; color: #4d4d4d; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px; color: #4d4d4d; background-color: #ffffff;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: medium;\">Componentes Batom 8516</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; padding: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 25px; color: #4d4d4d; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: large;\">Caprylic/Capric Glycerides, Polybutene, Bis-Diglyceryl Polyacyladipate-2, Diisostearyl Malate, Hydroxystearic Acid, Dicaprylyl Carbonate, Synthetic Wax, Tocopheryl Acetate, Parfum, Benzyl Salicylate, Buthylphenyl Methylpropional, Linalool. Pode conter: Mica, Tin Oxide, CI 77499, CI 77491, CI 45410, CI 15850, CI 77492, CI 77891, CI 17140, CI 16035</span></p>', 4.98, 9.99, 2.00, 12.00, 0.00, '', '', 0, 'N', NULL, 'N', 0, NULL, 'N', '', 'batom-matte-vermelho-vivo-1', 'Batom Matte Vermelho Vivo 1', '2020-10-06 20:04:19', '2022-11-09 10:20:35', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2163, ' HB8516200', 'UN', '0', 87, 85, 150, 'Batom Matte Vermelho Cereja 200', 'Compre Batom Matte Vermelho Cereja 200 Ruby Rose Com 7% de desconto à vista no Boleto', '<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Use o <strong>Batom Matte 8516 200</strong> da Ruby Rose e tenha um acabamento Matte natural!</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">A linha do Batom Matte 8516 200 tem efeito Semi-Matte e cont&eacute;m mais de 36 cores com alta cobertura para voc&ecirc; expressar de forma aut&ecirc;ntica a sua personalidade, atrav&eacute;s das cores que variam entre neutras e vibrantes!</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>Refer&ecirc;ncia:</strong> HB8516200</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>Efeito:</strong> Semi-Matte</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>Design:</strong> Moderno e f&aacute;cil de utilizar</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">As Imagens do Batom Matte 8516 37 Cacau s&atilde;o meramente ilustrativas. Visualiza&ccedil;&otilde;es em mobile e desktop podem sofrer altera&ccedil;&otilde;es de cor.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Sugest&otilde;es de aplica&ccedil;&atilde;o do Batom 8516 37</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Aplique o Batom canto em dire&ccedil;&atilde;o ao centro dos l&aacute;bios, logo depois preencha a parte interna deixando-o uniforme</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Para finalizar, caso voc&ecirc; borre ou cometa alguma falha na aplica&ccedil;&atilde;o a mesma pode ser removida com um lencinho ou cotonete.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Precau&ccedil;&otilde;es:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Uso externo. N&atilde;o aplique sobre a pele irritada ou lesionada. Se houver qualquer sinal de irrita&ccedil;&atilde;o, descontinue o uso do produto! Mantenha em ambientes com temperatura at&eacute; 40&ordm; C.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Componentes Batom 8516</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Caprylic/Capric Glycerides, Polybutene, Bis-Diglyceryl Polyacyladipate-2, Diisostearyl Malate, Hydroxystearic Acid, Dicaprylyl Carbonate, Synthetic Wax, Tocopheryl Acetate, Parfum, Benzyl Salicylate, Buthylphenyl Methylpropional, Linalool. Pode conter: Mica, Tin Oxide, CI 77499, CI 77491, CI 45410, CI 15850, CI 77492, CI 77891, CI 17140, CI 16035</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 4.98, 9.99, 2.00, 12.00, 0.00, '', '', 0, 'N', NULL, 'N', 0, NULL, 'N', '', 'batom-matte-vermelho-cereja-200', 'Batom Matte Vermelho Cereja 200', '2020-10-06 20:08:34', '2022-11-09 10:20:16', NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2164, 'HB554', 'UN', '0', 87, 85, 151, 'Gel Tint Fresh Red', 'Compre Gel Tint Fresh Red com 7% de desconto à vista no Boleto', '<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;Gel Tint Fresh Red &ndash; Ruby Rose&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\">O Gel Tint &eacute; perfeito para real&ccedil;ar a cor natural dos seus l&aacute;bios. S&atilde;o 4 tonalidades para dar aquela apar&ecirc;ncia saud&aacute;vel e corada na make. Ele tem longa dura&ccedil;&atilde;o, &oacute;tima pigmenta&ccedil;&atilde;o que deixa os seus l&aacute;bios coradinhos o dia todo. Ele n&atilde;o escorre e n&atilde;o transfere. Ah, e cada um deles tem um cheirinho delicioso.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\">Al&eacute;m disso o Gel Tint &eacute; super vers&aacute;til e pode ser usado nas bochechas como blush l&iacute;quido. &Eacute; s&oacute; aplicar duas a tr&ecirc;s gotinhas e espalhar para ganhar aquele efeito corado de praia.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relative; z-index: 0; margin-top: 5px; width: auto; color: #444444; font-family: \'PT Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14.3px; background-color: #ffffff;\">Esse Gel Tint ainda possui dois componentes que ir&atilde;o deixar seus l&aacute;bios super hidratados e saud&aacute;veis que &eacute; o &aacute;cido hialur&ocirc;nico e D-Pantenol.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px; position: relat