. Se houver qualquer sinal de irrita&ccedil;&atilde;o, descontinue o uso do produto! Mantenha em ambientes com temperatura at&eacute; 40&ordm; C.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Componentes Batom 8516</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Caprylic/Capric Glycerides, Polybutene, Bis-Diglyceryl Polyacyladipate-2, Diisostearyl Malate, Hydroxystearic Acid, Dicaprylyl Carbonate, Synthetic Wax, Tocopheryl Acetate, Parfum, Benzyl Salicylate, Buthylphenyl Methylpropional, Linalool. Pode conter: Mica, Tin Oxide, CI 77499, CI 77491, CI 45410, CI 15850, CI 77492, CI 77891, CI 17140, CI 16035</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 4.98, 9.99, 2.00, 12.00, 0.00, '', '', 0, 'N', NULL, 'N', 0, NULL, 'N', '', 'batom-matte-283', 'Batom Matte 283', '2020-11-25 20:38:24', '2022-09-23 12:17:49', NULL, NULL, NULL),
